mission "The Last Pilot of the Crown"
    name "The Last Pilot of the Crown"
    description "Find retired pilot Tomas Vale, whose family once guided the lost expedition."
    source "Havana"
    destination "Crown's Fall"
    reward 1070
    speaker offer "Tomas Vale"
    speaker visit "Tomas Vale"
    speaker complete "Tomas Vale"
    to offer
        has "A Convenient Forgery: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `Tomas Vale has retired from piloting, but his old charts still hang in the back room. Several carry the same western marks found on the expedition's surviving papers.`
            `Vale studies the marks for a long while. "My family guided that expedition. We were told it was a routine survey; then the orders were sealed and the ships never came home. I have no wish to see the same lie passed down another generation."`
            choice
                `"Let us see where this trail leads. I am in."`
                    accept
                `"You are choosing your words carefully. Why?"`
                    goto details
                `"I cannot spare the risk or the men."`
                    close
            label details
                `He takes a rolled chart from the wall. "I kept the course notes, not the orders. Bring me the old marks and I can tell you which passages my family was told to steer clear of."`
                choice
                    `"Then I will see it done. No more delays."`
                        accept
                    `"I will not be persuaded. Farewell."`
                        close
    on accept
        log "Accepted The Last Pilot of the Crown. Find retired pilot Tomas Vale, whose family once guided the lost expedition."
    on visit
        conversation
            `At Crown's Fall, Tomas lays the family charts beside the expedition's notes. The marks point toward a place removed from official maps. "We were told to keep our heading and ask no questions," he says. "Now I know why the questions mattered."`
    on complete
        conversation
            `Tomas closes the chart case. "I cannot change what my family did not know. But I can tell you what they saw. Take the truth to the people who live along that coast; they have waited long enough."`
        log "Completed The Last Pilot of the Crown. Received 1070 gold. Find retired pilot Tomas Vale, whose family once guided the lost expedition."
